"lines": [
{
"text": "As people grew numerous",
"start": 3.56,
"end": 5.06
},
{
"text": "upon the earth,",
"start": 6.18,
"end": 7.381
},
{
"text": "daughters were born to them.",
"start": 8.781,
"end": 11.321
},
{
"text": "The sons of God saw",
"start": 12.861,
"end": 14.721
},
{
"text": "the daughters of men were beautiful;",
"start": 14.881,
"end": 17.181
},
{
"text": "they took as wives",
"start": 17.861,
"end": 19.242
},
{
"text": "whomever they chose.",
"start": 19.402,
"end": 21.822
},
{
"text": "The Lord God said,",
"start": 22.382,
"end": 23.402
},
{
"text": "My Spirit will not stay",
"start": 23.482,
"end": 25.322
},
{
"text": "with these men forever;",
"start": 25.362,
"end": 26.842
},
{
"text": "they are flesh.",
"start": 26.922,
"end": 27.722
},
{
"text": "Their days will be",
"start": 27.822,
"end": 29.022
},
{
"text": "one hundred twenty years.",
"start": 29.682,
"end": 31.602
},
{
"text": "Giants lived upon the earth",
"start": 31.822,
"end": 33.563
},
{
"text": "in those days and afterward.",
"start": 33.623,
"end": 36.283
},
{
"text": "The sons of God came",
"start": 36.563,
"end": 38.923
},
{
"text": "to the daughters of men;",
"start": 39.083,
"end": 41.283
},
{
"text": "their children were the giants of old,",
"start": 41.363,
"end": 46.144
},
{
"text": "men of renown.",
"start": 46.344,
"end": 50.364
},
{
"text": "The Lord God saw wickedness",
"start": 50.764,
"end": 57.465
},
{
"text": "multiply upon the earth.",
"start": 59.865,
"end": 62.225
},
{
"text": "Every heart was brooding",
"start": 63.185,
"end": 65.545
},
{
"text": "over evil without end.",
"start": 65.705,
"end": 67.705
},
{
"text": "God took it to heart",
"start": 67.985,
"end": 69.645
},
{
"text": "that He had made mankind;",
"start": 69.685,
"end": 71.406
},
{
"text": "He pondered it deeply.",
"start": 71.466,
"end": 74.126
},
{
"text": "God said, I will wipe away",
"start": 74.806,
"end": 77.926
},
{
"text": "the people I have made,",
"start": 78.186,
"end": 80.346
},
{
"text": "and cattle, creatures that crawl,",
"start": 80.766,
"end": 82.786
},
{
"text": "and birds of the sky.",
"start": 83.027,
"end": 84.567
},
{
"text": "I grieve that I have made them.",
"start": 85.107,
"end": 88.367
},
{
"text": "But Noe found grace",
"start": 89.227,
"end": 92.627
},
{
"text": "before the Lord God.",
"start": 95.988,
"end": 97.688
},
{
"text": "These are the generations of Noe.",
"start": 98.948,
"end": 104.488
},
{
"text": "He was a just man,",
"start": 104.908,
"end": 106.988
},
{
"text": "perfect in his generation,",
"start": 107.088,
"end": 109.589
},
{
"text": "and pleasing to God.",
"start": 110.029,
"end": 112.029
},
{
"text": "Noe fathered three sons:",
"start": 112.109,
"end": 114.449
},
{
"text": "Shem, Ham and Japheth.",
"start": 114.529,
"end": 116.689
},
{
"text": "The earth was corrupt before God;",
"start": 116.769,
"end": 120.209
},
{
"text": "it was filled with wrong.",
"start": 120.229,
"end": 121.87
},
{
"text": "The Lord God looked on the earth",
"start": 121.91,
"end": 124.23
},
{
"text": "and saw its corruption;",
"start": 124.35,
"end": 126.71
},
{
"text": "all flesh had corrupted its way.",
"start": 126.81,
"end": 130.99
},
{
"text": "The Lord God said to Noe,",
"start": 131.17,
"end": 133.61
},
{
"text": "The end of all men is before Me.",
"start": 133.65,
"end": 136.011
},
{
"text": "They have filled the earth with wrong;",
"start": 136.151,
"end": 138.591
},
{
"text": "I will destroy them",
"start": 138.611,
"end": 140.691
},
{
"text": "and the earth.",
"start": 141.051,
"end": 142.191
},
{
"text": "Make yourself an ark",
"start": 142.711,
"end": 144.271
},
{
"text": "of square timber,",
"start": 144.651,
"end": 146.251
},
{
"text": "with rooms inside;",
"start": 147.372,
"end": 148.852
},
{
"text": "coat it within and without",
"start": 148.932,
"end": 151.092
},
{
"text": "with pitch.",
"start": 151.212,
"end": 151.972
},
{
"text": "Make the ark three hundred cubits long,",
"start": 152.132,
"end": 155.092
},
{
"text": "fifty cubits wide,",
"start": 155.232,
"end": 156.832
},
{
"text": "and thirty cubits high.",
"start": 156.912,
"end": 160.693
},
{
"text": "Narrow the ark as you build it;",
"start": 161.073,
"end": 163.933
},
{
"text": "finish it a cubit above.",
"start": 164.033,
"end": 166.453
},
{
"text": "Put its door in the side,",
"start": 166.513,
"end": 168.733
},
{
"text": "and make lower, second",
"start": 168.833,
"end": 170.673
},
{
"text": "and third stories.",
"start": 170.773,
"end": 172.154
},
{
"text": "I will bring a flood of water",
"start": 172.854,
"end": 176.394
},
{
"text": "upon the earth.",
"start": 176.474,
"end": 177.454
},
{
"text": "All flesh that breathes beneath heaven",
"start": 177.614,
"end": 179.874
},
{
"text": "will perish;",
"start": 180.014,
"end": 180.954
},
{
"text": "everything on earth will die.",
"start": 181.374,
"end": 187.855
},
{
"text": "But I will establish",
"start": 187.915,
"end": 192.775
},
{
"text": "My covenant with you.",
"start": 193.115,
"end": 194.895
},
{
"text": "Enter the ark with your sons,",
"start": 195.155,
"end": 197.756
},
{
"text": "your wife, and your sons' wives.",
"start": 198.096,
"end": 202.216
},
{
"text": "Bring pairs of every living kind",
"start": 202.836,
"end": 205.656
},
{
"text": "into the ark with you:",
"start": 205.776,
"end": 207.456
},
{
"text": "cattle, creatures that crawl,",
"start": 207.856,
"end": 210.096
},
{
"text": "and wild beasts.",
"start": 210.217,
"end": 211.597
},
{
"text": "Feed them there with you,",
"start": 211.737,
"end": 213.577
},
{
"text": "male and female.",
"start": 213.957,
"end": 216.097
},
{
"text": "Birds after their kind,",
"start": 216.217,
"end": 218.277
},
{
"text": "cattle after their kind,",
"start": 218.337,
"end": 220.237
},
{
"text": "all that crawl after their kind:",
"start": 220.457,
"end": 223.078
},
{
"text": "pairs of each will come to you,",
"start": 223.298,
"end": 225.418
},
{
"text": "male and female, to be fed.",
"start": 225.618,
"end": 228.038
},
{
"text": "Gather every kind of food",
"start": 228.118,
"end": 230.558
},
{
"text": "that you eat;",
"start": 230.638,
"end": 231.738
},
{
"text": "store it for yourself",
"start": 231.878,
"end": 236.959
},
{
"text": "and for them.",
"start": 237.679,
"end": 240.279
},
{
"text": "Noe did everything",
"start": 240.739,
"end": 242.619
},
{
"text": "the Lord God commanded him.",
"start": 244.199,
"end": 248.279
},
{
"text": "He did it all.",
"start": 249.28,
"end": 252.7
}
],
